<title>CROATIA: Croatian February output up 1.8 pct m/m, 2 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatian February output up 1.8 pct m/m, 2 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   FEBRUARY    JANUARY    FEB '96</p>
<p> Monthly change pct		+1.8	 +3.1	 -0.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	     +2.0	 -0.4	 +2.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1995)		101.4	 99.6	 99.4</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data include estimates for Serb-held Croatian territory where production amounted to two percent of the total before 1991.</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
